# Language

Use `AGENTS.md`, `docs/spec/constitution.md`, `CLAUDE.md`,
`docs/spec/grammar.md`, and `docs/spec/corpus.md`.

Canonical source is `.id`. The language is Idsem. `.duo`, Duo, and Duon are
historical bootstrap identities unless an authority file names the exact
compatibility boundary. Do not use examples or historical files as language
law.
